plaintext
* NPN BJTs
Q1 3 8 2 NPN
Q2 4 6 2 NPN

* Current Source
I1 2 0 DC IEE

* Nodes:
* 1: + (positive voltage rail)
* 2: Common node/Ground
* 3: Collector of Q1
* 4: Input V_id / Base of Q2
* 5: Base of Q1
* 6: Emitter of Q2
* 7: Connection between V_id and base of Q2
* 8: Input to Q1

.model NPN NPN
.end